{"title":"2024 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a sequence with six terms, each term after the second is the sum of the previous two terms. If the fourth term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the sixth term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, what is the first term?==Solution 1==\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd28b278a07bda0ea4d08737743613980c6aa6a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> be the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term of the sequence. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/5/995dfaa8703fd79a459a33e4619e28eaa7ea90df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n} = a_{n - 1} + a_{n - 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/7/097569af11a8c230c95e6550101ff0b0e7ac7958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> from the problem.\n</p><p>Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/247db33f0b52390369c0908d454b692f12d4d3de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{6} = a_{6 - 1} + a_{6 - 2} = a_{5} + a_{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/07232403763c3dae1ea24a85d3eca6c221d4155a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 = a_{5} + 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/4/5d4f5d212bdb89a4d9a379bc3ddb9432ebe04bef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{5} = 36 - 13 = 23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/caed7d8858fea37d9517f53b8e2a3737c0e2a1a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{5} = a_{5 - 1} + a_{5 - 2} = a_{4} + a_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/0/0b067393b8ef7a41ef3e9fbf0aa28236c5a4bc1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23 = 13 + a_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/4/5a4c167a78df71daf1348d7742370ca0b5c67e51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{3} = 23 - 13 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />th term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />rd term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/b/09bd2a0e18d322b28410da450a21483ceb0ddf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{4} = a_{4 - 1} + a_{4 - 2} = a_{3} + a_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/6/0b67787f4e17ffcc52f4994f4bd16d8df27fb6b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 = 10 + a_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/9/9f9ca755b932c81498e6f7674e63f2573d34183e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2} = 13 - 10 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />rd term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />nd term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb244a81960312083d909b685f86537761477c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{3} = a_{3 - 1} + a_{3 - 2} = a_{2} + a_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/0/7b0ee6c97e8c55cb54c3ad71d002e0d7b8a9a563.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 = 3 + a_{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/3/1637d50f29d4e553c3d79ecde0903972190cf2dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{1} = 10 - 3 = \\boxed{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"137\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025615\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 109/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6185/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.846      1 2024_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.846      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35991:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025615 and revision id 279582. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}